0,99],"id":310392,"origin_country":["IN"],"original_language":"hi","original_name":"Honeymoon Se Hatya","overview":"A five-part true-crime docudrama uncovers real cases where wives kill their husbands. The series dives deep into how love, control, betrayal and hidden marital fractures can lead to fatal breakdowns","popularity":1.5703,"poster_path":"/wxi68hCKtlxg7zJSF9WWc2nUkYh.jpg","first_air_date":"2026-01-09","softcore":false,"name":"Honeymoon Se Hatya","vote_average":8,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[10765],"id":212521,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Ghost Tales","overview":"A genre-jumping anthology series wherein individuals communicate with the dead.","popularity":2.0585,"poster_path":null,"first_air_date":"2022-11-04","softcore":false,"name":"Ghost Tales","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/wIe1HL7oMNwyltsqqx2sCPwNl4w.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10762],"id":2304,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Thomas & Friends","overview":"Thomas & Friends is a British children's television series, which had its first broadcast on the ITV network on 4 September 1984. It is based on The Railway Series of books by the Reverend Wilbert Awdry and his son, Christopher Awdry. These books deal with the adventures of a group of anthropomorphised locomotives and road vehicles who live on the fictional Island of Sodor. The books were based on stories Wilbert told to entertain his son, Christopher during his recovery from measles. From Series one to four, many of the stories are based on events from Awdry's personal experience.","popularity":50.911,"poster_path":"/wrFb5dE2yxUjz3a5V7PEXPPzsFU.jpg","first_air_date":"1984-10-09","softcore":false,"name":"Thomas & Friends","vote_average":6.8,"vote_count":161},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/pYNE1C8LkXLecSSxpLBkE8WkpTO.jpg","genre_ids":[35,10764],"id":129412,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Game Changer","overview":"In this game show, the game changes every show! Players begin each round without knowing the rules -- and must figure them out while competing to win.","popularity":28.265,"poster_path":"/6kel6DiavQEDOOMJQQoz21MrV5B.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-09-20","softcore":false,"name":"Game Changer","vote_average":8.369,"vote_count":61},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6YMuWmlXKQkhQ0FiwDo9zmIsnEb.jpg","genre_ids":[18,35],"id":280030,"origin_country":["TR"],"original_language":"tr","original_name":"Gassal","overview":"A Turkish mortician in his 30s, Baki is an introverted man content with his isolation from society. However, when he comes up against death at close range, a troubling question strikes him: who would wash his body after he dies? This realization pushes him to venture out into the world, hoping to connect with people and perhaps even find a spouse. Yet, his life-changing decision proves difficult to go through with, leading to a series of awkwardly humorous and sometimes bizarre situations.","popularity":5.8997,"poster_path":"/7Xaw2vjMEn6KyENB6JksVrXIq8W.jpg","first_air_date":"2024-12-20","softcore":false,"name":"The Late Offices","vote_average":8,"vote_count":41},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/a9keLyhn2ioSMYD6ZggmSiOAUTZ.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":96061,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"亜空大作戦 スラングル","overview":"It is the year 86 of the New Galaxy. In a binary star system somewhere in space, there is a special area called Zone Subsqui, which converged all the races of the galaxy to form a new civilization.\n\nHowever, alongside the progress, crime flourished, and the Organization of Evil became the scourge of the new order, exhibiting powers above those of the space authorities. It was therefore decided that, to combat the Organization of Evil, a group composed of brilliant scientists and brave warriors would be created, known as Gorilla Force.","popularity":6.2836,"poster_path":"/fjjRuxZiS